"cpsd2hbn2lbn": {
"body": "Sui has officially marked JSON-RPC as deprecated and is requiring developers to migrate to either gRPC or GraphQL RPC by July 2026. You can read more in Sui's blogs below:\nhttps://docs.sui.io/develop/accessing-data/data-serving\nhttps://docs.sui.io/develop/accessing-data/json-rpc-migration\n\nThe good news: Quicknode has you covered with support of both gRPC and GraphQL for Sui, and we've just made gRPC even more accessible with two new additions:\n\n- gRPC-web transport support  - enabling browser-based clients to connect seamlessly over port 443\n- gRPC traffic now served over port 443 - simplifying firewall and infrastructure configuration\n\nIf you need help getting started with gRPC or GraphQL on Quicknode, please check out our docs:\nhttps://www.quicknode.com/docs/sui",
